## Architecture

```
wpipe/
├── pipe/           # Pipeline and Condition implementation
├── api_client/    # API communication
├── sqlite/        # Database operations
├── log/          # Logging utilities
├── ram/          # Memory utilities
├── util/         # YAML utilities
└── exception/    # Custom exceptions
```

